<title>USA: LoJack Corp Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>LoJack Corp Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>DEDHAM, Mass. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			    November 30,	    November 30,</p>
<p>			1996	  1995	    1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revenues   $15,132,000 $13,600,000   $46,047,000 $38,924,000</p>
<p>Operating Income before depreciation and amortization</p>
<p>		  3,374,000   3,089,000    10,744,000   7,990,000</p>
<p>Pre-Tax Income</p>
<p>		  3,158,000   2,750,000    10,201,000   6,950,000</p>
<p> Net income 1,927,000  2,560,000(A)   6,224,000  6,426,000(A)</p>
<p> Per share:	   .09	.11(A)	     .27	.28(A)</p>
<p>Average shares</p>
<p>		 22,485,000  23,622,000    22,953,000  23,279,000</p>
<p>NOTES: A) Includes recognition of $822,500 and $2,182,000 of net operating loss carryforwards in the three and nine months ending November 30, 1995, representing $0.04 and $0.09 per share respectively.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
